{"name":"Borderline","hex":"#c69b58","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"borderline","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Nearly; not clearly on one side or the other of a border or boundary, ambiguous.","Of questionable taste or acceptability; approaching bad taste."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Nearly; not entirely but nevertheless to a great extent."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/borderline"}],"entries":[{"title":"Borderline (1930 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Borderline is a 1930 film, written and directed by Kenneth Macpherson and produced by the Pool Group in Territet, Switzerland. The silent film, with English title cards, is primarily noted for its handling of the contentious issue of interracial relationships, using avant-garde experimental film-making techniques."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/Title_card_borderlibe_macpherson.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borderline_(1930_film)","wikidata":"Q2910742"},{"title":"Borderline (1950 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Borderline is a 1950 American crime film noir directed by William A. Seiter and starring Fred MacMurray and Claire Trevor. It was filmed from late May to early July 1949 at Republic Studios."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borderline_(1950_film)","wikidata":"Q2910748"},{"title":"Borderline (2025 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Borderline is a 2025 American comedy thriller film written and directed by Jimmy Warden in his directorial debut. Starring Samara Weaving, Ray Nicholson, Jimmie Fails, Alba Baptista, and Eric Dane, the film centers on a pop star (Weaving) whose home is invaded by an obsessive fan (Nicholson) who believes they are meant to get married and manipulates her into going along with his delusion."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6c/Borderline_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borderline_(2025_film)","wikidata":"Q130381570"},{"title":"Borderline (2024 TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Borderline is an Irish and Northern Irish police procedural television series set on the border between Ireland and Northern Ireland, where crimes affect both sides of the border. The cast is led by Eoin Macken and Amy De Bhrún and also includes Lochlann O'Mearain and Hugh O'Conor as well as Charlotte Bradley, Sophie Vavasseur, Craig McGinlay, and Jack Hickey. It was broadcast in September 2024."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borderline_(2024_TV_series)","wikidata":"Q130342718"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2e/Borderline_-_1950_Poster.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2e/Borderline_-_1950_Poster.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABorderline_-_1950_Poster.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Borderline_%281950%29_1.jpg/500px-Borderline_%281950%29_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Borderline_%281950%29_1.jpg/500px-Borderline_%281950%29_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Roy Roberts, Claire Trevor, Jose Torvay and Fred MacMurray in Borderline","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABorderline_(1950)_1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Richard_Irving-Claire_Trevor_in_Borderline.jpg/500px-Richard_Irving-Claire_Trevor_in_Borderline.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Richard_Irving-Claire_Trevor_in_Bor